- **Closing the leaks: delivered for FFI parked-continuation accumulation, partial for isolation.** The bridge lives inside the VM record and is driven by `vm/run`. All parked FFI calls share one cursor, so out-of-order responses throw instead of routing. The VM itself has no races to fix since it is immutable data on one thread.

